{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117583","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117583/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117583/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117583/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117583","id":4097268604,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7LpOXh","number":117583,"title":"Use `TRACY_ON_DEMAND` by default for Tracy integration","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-03-18T19:25:40Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T11:48:31Z","closed_at":"2026-03-23T21:45:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117583","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117583.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117583.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-23T21:45:25Z"},"body":"Fixes #115798.\r\n\r\nAs per Tracy's manual ([PDF here](https://github.com/wolfpld/tracy/releases/latest/download/tracy.pdf)) Tracy will accumulate events even before you've connected a client to it. This accumulation can be hundreds of megabytes per second for non-trivial applications, pretty much forcing you to have Tracy running (and have it set to use a memory limit) if you don't want to cause crashes or severe slowdowns of your system due to running out of memory.\r\n\r\nHowever, Tracy offers a `TRACY_ON_DEMAND` compile definition that stops it from accumulating these events when there isn't a client connected:\r\n\r\n<details><summary>[Click to expand/collapse]</summary>\r\n<p>\r\n<img width=\"799\" height=\"341\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9797d1a6-592f-4995-9998-b564e62e45d4\" />\r\n</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nTherefore, this pull request adds a new build option called `profiler_record_on_demand`, which maps to `TRACY_ON_DEMAND`, allowing you to omit `TRACY_ON_DEMAND` by disabling this new option.\r\n\r\nThis new option is enabled by default, meaning `TRACY_ON_DEMAND` is now enabled/provided, since the current behavior without it seems very costly, especially since even when the Tracy client is connected its memory allocations seem quite intense, effectively limiting how long you can record samples for in general, with or without this new build option:\r\n\r\n<details><summary>[Click to expand/collapse]</summary>\r\n<p>\r\n<img width=\"801\" height=\"243\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ec4aace-9829-41a0-9129-d7d9e5419722\" />\r\n</p>\r\n</details>","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117583/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117583/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}